From 8c12d8ef5f9c58486c2ed9e8e233b28c0c0f19ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:31:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] arm64, ARM: dts: add Samsung Q60T TV with Nike-L SoC

Minimal device trees for the Samsung Q60T television (Nike-L SoC) in
the two memory profiles found in firmware T-NKLDEUC 2743.0: CPUs, PSCI,
GIC-400, architected timer, PMU and the four SDP UARTs. Values are taken
from the firmware device tree. The arm32 trees include the arm64 ones.
